# agenix-rekey writes each rekeyed secret into a .tmp.agenix-rekey.<name>.<rand>/
# directory under the host's storage dir and moves it into place on success. An
# interrupted `just rekey` leaves one behind; committing it would put a stray
# copy of a secret in the tree under a name nothing reads.
.tmp.agenix-rekey.*
